cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Gentrex, please cite the version you used.
title: "Gentrex: Genetic Test Report eXtraction"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Hieu
    family-names: Le
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/hieutdle/gentrex"
abstract: >-
  Gentrex turns clinical genetic test reports in PDF form into one structured
  record per report, with language models that run on your own GPUs. It
  normalizes genes to HGNC, diseases to MONDO and clinical features to HPO,
  loads the records into SQL databases, and exports them as GA4GH
  Phenopackets, into an OMOP CDM and as HL7 FHIR Genomics Reporting Bundles.
keywords:
  - clinical genetics
  - genetic test reports
  - information extraction
  - large language models
  - Phenopackets
  - OMOP CDM
  - HL7 FHIR
